<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-002" ;
  triage:title "SendOutcome.already_closed has no producer; atm task close reports a false success" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. SendOutcome.already_closed has no producer; `atm task close` reports a false success. Doc says: nudge-task-design.md §5.2: already complete -> DELIVER the message, INFORM the caller. sprint-BA.4:213 requires stage 3 to print 'task <id> was already closed (<outcome>); report delivered', exit 0. Code does: apply_task_close correctly returns Ok(Some(already)) at task_ops.rs:532-542, but the dispatcher discards it: `Some(TaskOp::Close { .. }) => apply_task_close(...).map(|_| ())`. Every construction site of SendOutcome hardcodes `already_closed: None` (crates/atm-core/src/send/outcome.rs:29 decl; None at write/pipeline.rs:502, send/write_context.rs:47, atm/src/composition.rs:1115, atm-http-runtime/src/message_handler.rs:1067, client.rs:1179, plus graft sites) and the field is never mutated. The CLI branch at crates/atm/src/commands/task.rs:353 is unreachable. Recommendation: Thread the Option<TaskCloseOutcome> from apply_task_close through apply_task_message and the write pipeline into SendOutcome, or delete the field and the CLI branch. Do not ship a governed (ADR-061) interface field that is structurally always None. fenix's ruling: thread the real TaskCloseOutcome through SendOutcome.already_closed instead of hardcoding None." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "correctness" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/writer/task_ops.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A97CP7ZRAC882G0DD78AE5, 2026-09-12T07:45:02Z): fixed at review-2 92995d258 (fix) + 33754d69d (dead-code correction; contract.rs back to 977 prod lines). fenix (ATM 01M2A9ATC16T0YXH1T71T7ZHA8, 2026-09-12T07:46:54Z): gate confirmation -- 33754d69d is gate-green on fenix's host, RULE-003 included. Status fixed at 33754d69d stands, nothing pending." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
